{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_85accfa3635dbc0d6bb6a30a9b7610cda1d1a48bedf3564256ac339a2bf44158","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"awslabs/cli-agent-orchestrator@948c3d8004fa snapshot e8d798b8201b64d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_16323d1942af4e186abc16b27f47b208c1574e0d092261b8f2897046b693c280"],"source_ids":["src_74f324e69b0d55e3a7d548c455f19056"],"text":"CLI commands cao agent assign|handoff|send-message|status|result|cancel exist as a fallback when a terminal's MCP connection is unavailable, sharing an orchestration module with the MCP tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d25ac339bc8aaca4df03f77e80eff23628a1b57aec6449aeb7abf6040f94ad2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"awslabs/cli-agent-orchestrator@948c3d8004fa snapshot e8d798b8201b64d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_74dd7a12b674831267d4c424016d7d99be403a6fbe3a368e9db8d4f796610b06","slc_88a7bf48ae036a318bce6bdf8a05e7f3eeb0112fb66b7734fc0a3ee3f14629a7","slc_9829a29573b34266cb233a52d4c5658ae1cd83b16d07e9d6ab9b0f10af447542"],"source_ids":["src_74f324e69b0d55e3a7d548c455f19056"],"text":"The project floors at cryptography>=50.0.0 for two HIGH CVEs, pins nanoid >=3.3.17 via npm overrides for CVE-2026-67213, and bumped mcp to 1.28.1.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9661057684772b4e36c1d48a8e66bcf421f824910fc9a5314af36046298677a4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"awslabs/cli-agent-orchestrator@948c3d8004fa snapshot e8d798b8201b64d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ae2a475bd94f6d5f28b3d2b7e88abb9f2c49e93d6c4890af5f5da121ba13e13f"],"source_ids":["src_74f324e69b0d55e3a7d548c455f19056"],"text":"Sessions run in tmux terminals with a conductor concept: a session's first (oldest surviving) terminal is normally its conductor, and five consumers depend on that ordering.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a80ea9bd8bd3a66107d0d5094eef74417946ee52ab145020187f3007b2f6dcfa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"awslabs/cli-agent-orchestrator@948c3d8004fa snapshot e8d798b8201b64d1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5cc13ce9d3bfe75a08d2aaf903beac313de2266806fec6456f47a3e17337dd66"],"source_ids":["src_74f324e69b0d55e3a7d548c455f19056"],"text":"Windows is unsupported: the backend is tmux and four modules import fcntl at module scope, so the package refuses Windows at import with an explanation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:36:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2d92f8242c834dde82525719c0e2de71"}
